OL,4,CWe cannot keep our council tax pledge, 
OL,5,Csay Reform                             
OL,6,GThe Reform UK leader of Barnsley       
OL,7,GCouncil has said his party cannot keep 
OL,8,Gits election pledge to freeze council  
OL,9,Gtax.                                   
OL,11,FReform took control of Barnsley        
OL,12,FCouncil in May by winning 41 of the 63 
OL,13,Fseats, bringing to an end 50 years of  
OL,14,FLabour leadership.                     
OL,16,FDuring their campaign they distributed 
OL,17,Fleaflets promising not to increase     
OL,18,Fcouncil tax, but, in an interview with 
OL,19,FBBC Radio Sheffield, William Brown     
OL,20,Fsaid, after reviewing the situation,   
OL,21,Fsticking to the promise was "not       
OL,22,Fpossible".                        G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
