OL,4,CRepairing viaduct walkway expected to  
OL,5,Ccost #1m                               
OL,6,GThe expected cost of rebuilding a      
OL,7,Gcollapsed riverside walkway in         
OL,8,GKnaresborough has risen to more than   
OL,9,G#1m, councillors will be told.         
OL,11,FA wall and part of the riverbank fell  
OL,12,Finto the River Nidd in the North       
OL,13,FYorkshire market town in February      
OL,14,Ffollowing a landslip.                  
OL,16,F"People are always asking me when it's 
OL,17,Fgoing to get fixed. It does look       
OL,18,Fawful," said Liberal Democrat          
OL,19,Fcouncillor Matt Walker, citing "delay  
OL,20,Fafter delay".                          
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
